 ny Shyne vividly and patiently captures multiple generations of Black farm
 ing families in Thomas County\, Georgia\, from social challenges to financ
 ial straits and their dedication to one another. Winner of the US Grand Ju
 ry Prize - Documentary at Sundance 2025.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/
 seeds
