DTEND:20250518T053000Z
DTSTAMP:20250518T033000Z
UID:fdic3Ny7mO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 110 mins (1h50m)\n\nIn 1975\, Indigenous American Le
 onard Peltier was accused of shooting two FBI agents while defending South
  Dakota’s Pine Ridge Indian Reservation and then sentenced to two consec
 utive life sentences. As he faces his final years\, learn the real facts f
 rom those who fought for his clemency. Director Jesse Short Bull scheduled
  to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/free-leonard-peltier
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
